    "desc": "The team behind THIRSTY and CHEEKY delivers a funny, sexy, & exciting new comic series about the dancers at a New York strip club.\r\n\r\nPrivate Dance is an ADULTS ONLY comic that takes you into a New York strip club as we meet the dancers, customers, and bouncers, discovering that there is more to the fantasy than meets the eye.\r\n\r\nAt work, they create a fantasy for customers that you have to see to believe. However, when we take a closer look, there are a world of stories to explore in the real lives of these dancers.",
